SCOPED packages local modified snapshots of two upstream projects:

EasyR1: https://github.com/hiyouga/EasyR1
veRL: https://github.com/verl-project/verl

Their source copyright headers and Apache-2.0 licenses are retained in
src/easyr1 and src/verl. The veRL notice is retained as src/verl/Notice.txt.

Packaging changes include portable launch/config files and removal of
machine-specific legacy skill-path aliases from the public veRL copy, and
explicit local dataset split mappings in the public EasyR1 copy.
Private skill texts, credentials, cloud deployment files, model weights,
training outputs and LlamaFactory are not included in the code release.

The code license does not assign a license to third-party training images
or annotations. Dataset source licenses must be documented separately.
